  book_summary: A young girl named Little Red Riding Hood is sent by her mother to bring cake and wine to her sick grandmother. In the forest, she meets a wolf without realizing the danger. The wolf hurries to the grandmother's house and tricks her into opening the door. He then goes straight to her bed and eats her.
